<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" size="4" style="">{!Lead.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" size="4" style=""><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" size="4" style="">Hey there. We're glad that you found us. Now, let's talk about the problem you need us to help you fix..</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" size="4" style="">Well, yeah...&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" size="4" style=""><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" size="4" style="">There is obviously a reason that you are looking for real estate investment opportunities, and a team to help you build your empire.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" size="4" style=""><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4">We hear about obstacles holding folks back from building a portfolio of rental properties everyday. Here are the 3 challenges we here most often:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style=""><ul style=""><li style=""><font face="arial" size="4">Your local market just doesn't make sense for investing. Outrageous prices, usually combined with a terrible rent to price ratio to go along with it. I'm talking to you, California.</font></li></ul><ul style=""><li style=""><font face="arial" size="4">You just don't have time to go find deals! You work a full-time job, a family, and you like to spend some time with your golf clubs occasionally. How is it possible for you to find deals, make offers, follow up, deal with contracts, and then when you're finally finished with all that you still have to do the property mgmt- renters and toilets... no thanks.</font></li></ul><ul style=""><li><font face="arial" size="4">You have zero real estate experience, and wouldn't know where to begin putting all the pieces together that would be required to pull this off.</font></li></ul><div><font face="arial" size="4">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="4">The good news- challenges like these are what we specialize in helping you overcome.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="4"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="4">Everyday, we help folks all over the country to build portfolios of single family rental properties across 5 of the best rental markets in the U.S.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="4"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="4">As investors ourselves, we have already built the infastructure for you. The market research is long past done, the network of vendors is already in place. You get to walk in the door and plug into the systems that we have already built out with you in mind, all the way down to insurance, lenders to provide financing for you, title companies, lawyers, etc.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="4"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="4">Setting up this kind of powerful system would take any seasoned investor hundreds of hours to create. And we've already done it for you. So you're welcome. We just gave you a hundred hours back. Take your kid fishing 25 times this year.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="4"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="4">Now, you will need money. This isn't 2007. Bankers aren't giving out loans to labradoodles anymore.&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: large;">You will need $40-60k on average, per property. And you will need to get pre-qualified with one of our approved lenders, so if that's not possible for you right now, or there's warrants out for you or something crazy, that's cool. Catch up with us down the road.</span></div><div><font face="arial" size="4"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="4">But if you want to talk about building a portfolio, I promise you that you could not possibly have an obstacle that we could not help you overcome if you are truly serious about building a portfolio, about changing your life, and the lives of your family behind you.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="4"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="4">So <a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bde1-baba97f6-16a5bdb5-baba97f6-00000007-1s19g530acl5j8g9e2faj934keo7bi8u&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1">use this link to book a call for us</a> to talk this week. I'm looking forward to it.</font></div><div><br></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="4">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="4">Marq</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="4"><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bde1-baba97f6-16a5bdb5-baba97f6-00000007-1s19g530acl5j8g9e2faj934keo7bi8u&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1"><br></a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="4"><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bde1-baba97f6-16a5bdb5-baba97f6-00000007-1s19g530acl5j8g9e2faj934keo7bi8u&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1">———————————————————————</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#1155cc" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bde1-baba97f6-16a5bdb5-baba97f6-00000007-1s19g530acl5j8g9e2faj934keo7bi8u&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1"><img src="https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1nGEH5IZsXxv52rNbVJepefIlS1odDllU&amp;revid=0B6FqHnQBLWozakhvQ3dEdmVmSzd4aTl0TVU3cytoaEplYkZrPQ" width="420" height="287"></a></span></font></div>]]></td>
